<title>SINGAPORE: Yemen ups third quarter prices for Masila, Marib.</title>
<headline>Yemen ups third quarter prices for Masila, Marib.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yemen has increased the third quarter term price of its Masila crude by 15 cents per barrel and Marib Light by five cents, traders said on Monday.</p>
</text>
